 "nl": [
  "Apart from scada on HTTPS (TCP 443); engineering on DNS over UDP 53, all traffic originating in dns-servers must be dropped.",
  "Allow research to connect to edge-cache using syslog (UDP 514) and NTP (UDP 123) and IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "Deny all traffic from database to dns-servers (this overrides any public service).",
  "Allow backup to connect to hr using HTTP (TCP 80) and IMAP (TCP 143) and syslog (UDP 514).",
  "Restrict research so that its only permitted destinations are database on HTTPS (TCP 443); dev-lab on syslog (UDP 514); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "Apart from mail on NTP (UDP 123), all traffic originating in backup must be dropped.",
  "Make NTP (UDP 123) and HTTP (TCP 80) on vpn-users reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Allow dev-lab to connect to cameras using SMB (TCP 445) and LDAP (TCP 389).",
  "Apart from hr on NTP (UDP 123); dns-servers on NTP (UDP 123), all traffic originating in dev-lab must be dropped.",
  "Any zone may connect to dns-servers over HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "Allow dns-servers to connect to mail using PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and LDAP (TCP 389) and IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "Hosts in cameras may reach vpn-users over RTSP (TCP 554) and IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "Allow edge-cache to connect to nvr using HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "mail is isolated: it may only reach vpn-users on HTTPS (TCP 443); backup on NTP (UDP 123), and nothing else.",
  "database may use TCP ports 1024-65535 towards dev-lab, except PostgreSQL (TCP 5432), which must be blocked."
 ],
